# Q.6 — Two facts and two rules of Family Relations (Prolog-style)

**Facts**
```prolog
parent(john, mary).
parent(mary, susan).
```

**Rules**
```prolog
grandparent(X, Z) :- parent(X, Y), parent(Y, Z).
sibling(X, Y) :- parent(P, X), parent(P, Y), X \= Y.
```

