# **Q.1 (b)**  
### **C program to check password validity**

**Conditions:**  
1. At least 1 lowercase letter  
2. At least 1 uppercase letter  
3. At least 1 digit  
4. At least 1 special character  
5. Min length = 6  
6. Max length = 12  

### ✅ **Simple C Program**

```c
#include <stdio.h>
#include <string.h>
#include <ctype.h>

int main() {
    char pass[50];
    int lower = 0, upper = 0, digit = 0, special = 0;

    printf("Enter password: ");
    scanf("%s", pass);

    int len = strlen(pass);

    for (int i = 0; i < len; i++) {
        if (islower(pass[i])) lower = 1;
        else if (isupper(pass[i])) upper = 1;
        else if (isdigit(pass[i])) digit = 1;
        else special = 1;
    }

    if (lower && upper && digit && special && len >= 6 && len <= 12)
        printf("Password is VALID\n");
    else
        printf("Password is INVALID\n");

    return 0;
}
```

