# **Q.4 (b) OR — Media, Book, Tape using runtime polymorphism**

### **Base class − Media**  
Stores: title, price

### **Derived classes**  
- **Book** → number of pages  
- **Tape** → playing time  

### **Virtual function used → runtime polymorphism**

### ✅ **Simple code**

```cpp
#include <iostream>
using namespace std;

class Media {
protected:
    string title;
    float price;
public:
    virtual void getData() {
        cout << "Enter title: ";
        cin >> title;
        cout << "Enter price: ";
        cin >> price;
    }
    virtual void display() {}
};

class Book : public Media {
    int pages;
